Derived works
=============

The compatibility bridges below contain code taken from, and modified from, the
following GPL-3.0 projects. They are NOT the official frameworks: they emulate
their APIs on top of qs-core so third-party scripts keep working.

[bridge]/es_extended
    Based on ESX Legacy - https://github.com/esx-framework/esx_core
    Copyright (C) 2022-2026 ESX Framework
    License: GPL-3.0-only
    Modified for qs-core in 2026 (adapted to run on top of qs-core).
    Files containing ESX Legacy code (each carries a notice in its header):
        client/main.lua                              (ESX.UI.Menu)
        client/game.lua                              (also QBCore, see below)
        imports.lua
        server/main.lua                              (xPlayer accounts)
        server/bridge/inventory/oxinventory.lua
        server/bridge/inventory/qsinventory.lua
        server/classes/overrides/oxinventory.lua
        server/classes/overrides/qsinventory.lua

[bridge]/qb-core
    Based on QBCore - https://github.com/qbcore-framework/qb-core
    Copyright (C) QBCore Framework and contributors
    License: GPL-3.0
    Modified for qs-core in 2026 (adapted to run on top of qs-core).
    Files containing QBCore code (each carries a notice in its header):
        fxmanifest.lua
        client/functions.lua
        server/exports.lua
        server/main.lua
        shared/functions.lua
        shared/locale.lua
        shared/main.lua
    Also [bridge]/es_extended/client/game.lua (vehicle properties).

The other bridges ([bridge]/esx_society, [bridge]/qb-management,
[bridge]/qb-vehiclekeys, [bridge]/progressbar, [bridge]/LegacyFuel) are original
qs-core code that only reproduces the public API names of those resources.


